cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this cryptanalytic solver or musical reconstruction, please cite it as below."
title: "The Dorabella Cipher: Melodic Reconstruction and Cryptanalytic Solution"
abstract: "An end-to-end information-theoretic and musical solution to Edward Elgar's 1897 Dorabella Cipher, decoding the 87 symbols into a dual-track G Major musical score aligning with Chanson de Matin and Enigma Variation X."
